    "en": {
      "name": "Gilford the Lightning, the Warrior of Thunderbolts",
      "effect": "You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by Tributing 3 monsters, and if you Tributed a monster(s) that is owned by your opponent, your opponent cannot activate cards or effects when this card is Special Summoned this way. If Summoned this way: Your opponent must send all monsters they control to the GY. If this card is sent to the GY: You can activate this effect; during the End Phase of this turn, add 1 Warrior monster from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of \"Gilford the Lightning, the Warrior of Thunderbolts\" once per turn.",
